$ Atomic mobilities of Cr, Fe and Ni in bcc Cr-Fe-Ni (paramagnetic part).
$ Transcribed from the Appendix (p. 1421) of
$   B. Jonsson, "Assessment of the mobilities of Cr, Fe and Ni in bcc Cr-Fe-Ni
$   alloys", ISIJ International 35 (1995) 1415-1421.
$ The paper writes M_B = exp(Theta_B) exp(-Q_B/RT) / RT (eqs. 3-4), so here
$ MF = R*T*Theta and MQ = -Q. Theta values given as a/R become a*T exactly.
$ Ternary parameters are entered for all three orders (CR=0, FE=1, NI=2 in
$ sorted order) so that no implicit symmetric expansion is applied.
$ The ferromagnetic factor mg-Omega of eq. (3) is not part of this file.
$ Test data only; thermodynamic (G) parameters are deliberately absent.
ELEMENT VA VACUUM 0 0 0 !
ELEMENT CR BCC_A2 51.996 0 0 !
ELEMENT FE BCC_A2 55.847 0 0 !
ELEMENT NI FCC_A1 58.69 0 0 !
TYPE_DEFINITION % SEQ * !
PHASE BCC_A2 % 2 1 3 !
CONSTITUENT BCC_A2 :CR,FE,NI:VA: !

$ Mobility of Cr
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&CR,CR:VA;0) 298.15 -35.6*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 R*T*LN(8.5E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&CR,NI:VA;0) 298.15 R*T*LN(8.5E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR:VA;0) 298.15 -407000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 -218000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,NI:VA;0) 298.15 -218000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 -116*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE:VA;1) 298.15 37.5*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 361000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE:VA;1) 298.15 2820; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR,NI:VA;0) 298.15 350000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 150000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 0; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE,NI:VA;1) 298.15 -2400000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&CR,CR,FE,NI:VA;2) 298.15 0; 6000 N !

$ Mobility of Fe
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&FE,CR:VA;0) 298.15 -17.2*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&FE,FE:VA;0) 298.15 R*T*LN(4.6E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 R*T*LN(4.6E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR:VA;0) 298.15 -407000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,FE:VA;0) 298.15 -218000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 -218000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 -117*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE:VA;1) 298.15 348*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 267000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE:VA;1) 298.15 -416000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR,NI:VA;0) 298.15 350000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 150000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 0; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE,NI:VA;1) 298.15 -1400000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&FE,CR,FE,NI:VA;2) 298.15 0; 6000 N !

$ Mobility of Ni
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&NI,CR:VA;0) 298.15 -17.2*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&NI,FE:VA;0) 298.15 R*T*LN(1.8E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&NI,NI:VA;0) 298.15 R*T*LN(1.8E-5); 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,CR:VA;0) 298.15 -407000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,FE:VA;0) 298.15 -204000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,NI:VA;0) 298.15 -204000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MF(BCC_A2&NI,CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 10*T; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,CR,FE:VA;0) 298.15 -88000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,CR,NI:VA;0) 298.15 350000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 150000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,CR,FE,NI:VA;0) 298.15 0; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,CR,FE,NI:VA;1) 298.15 -500000; 6000 N !
PARAMETER MQ(BCC_A2&NI,CR,FE,NI:VA;2) 298.15 0; 6000 N !
